// Owns "teen iop glastonbury ct", "teen iop connecticut / adolescent iop ct", "teen mental health treatment ct".
// Facts from the former page and src/data: Mon–Thu 5:00–8:00 PM, 1420 Main St Suite 124 (South Glastonbury),
// 8–12 weeks, parents weekly, Parent Support Group Tue + Parent Night Thu. The brief names East Hampton as the
// location; the client-confirmed office list puts Teen & Tween IOP at 1420 Main St only, so that is what the page says.
